{number: 142}
{title: Nearer, Still Nearer}
{key: Db}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[Db] Nearer, still nearer, [Gb] close to Thy [Db] heart,
Draw me, my Savior, so [Ab7] precious Thou [Db] art;
Fold me, O [Gb] fold me [Db] close to Thy [Ab7] breast,
[Db] Shelter me [Gb] safe in that [Db] haven of [Ab7] rest,
[Db] Shelter me [Gb] safe in that [Db] haven of [Ab7] [Db] rest.
